item.description:
&quot;Data stops being something you collect. It becomes something you compute.&quot;

At #SIGGRAPH2026, @liu_mingyu, VP of NVIDIA&apos;s Cosmos Lab, laid out why world models are the data engine of physical AI. Plus, he announced Cosmos-Dreams, a neural closed-loop simulator, and showed off a full demo of it in action.

You can watch the full keynote here: https://t.co/gyPDOcOZDK
